---
/* What the estimate form collects and where it goes. Descriptive only: every line is something
   this codebase does (EstimateWizard's fields, the campaign tags estimate.ts reads, the site's
   /api/lead endpoint that hands each request to Make for the owner's email and the lead list,
   Google Fonts, the Google Maps embed on the area pages, no analytics), so the page stays true until
   the code changes. Anything about how the business handles leads beyond that is the client's to
   add. noindex: a policy, not a page anyone searches for. */
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { phone, phoneHref, email } from '../data/brief';
const updated = '14 September 2026';
---
<Base title="Privacy | TIMELESS Grass & Greens" description="What the estimate form collects, where it is kept, and how to ask us to delete it." robots="noindex, follow">
  <section class="hero hero--sub turf-marks turf-marks--dark">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="micro micro--accent">Privacy</p>
      <h1>What happens to your details.</h1>
      <hr class="rule-ribbon" />
      <p class="hero__lede">You give us your name and number so we can call you about your estimate. Here is what the form collects and where it goes.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap doc__sec">
      <h2>What the estimate form collects</h2>
      <p>What you want installed, roughly how big the area is, when you would like it done, your town or ZIP code, your name and phone number, and your email address if you choose to give it. The submission also records the page where you opened the form.</p>
      <p>If you reached this site from an ad or a link with campaign tags, the submission also records those tags, the ad&rsquo;s click ID and the website that sent you. Your browser keeps them only until you close the tab, not in a cookie.</p>

      <h2>What we use it for</h2>
      <p>To call or email you about your estimate and your project, and to see which ads and pages bring in requests.</p>

      <h2>Where it is kept</h2>
      <p>When you send the form, this site passes your request to Make, an automation service, which emails it to us and adds it to the lead list our marketing agency keeps for us. The site itself does not keep a copy.</p>

      <h2>Other services this site uses</h2>
      <p>The fonts load from Google Fonts. The maps on our area pages are Google Maps, and Google may set cookies once a map loads. This site runs no advertising trackers and no analytics.</p>

      <h2>Deleting your details</h2>
      <p>
        Ask us and we will delete your submission:
        {phoneHref && <> call <a href={phoneHref}>{phone}</a></>}{email && <>{phoneHref ? ' or' : ''} email <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a></>}.
      </p>

      <p class="doc__meta">Last updated {updated}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
